{"id":"n2-074","title":"～っこない (〜kkonai)","jlptLevel":2,"shortExplanation":"Expresses the impossibility or very low probability of something happening; 'no way', 'impossible'.","longExplanation":"The ～っこない grammar point is used to express that something is impossible or extremely unlikely. It’s formed by attaching ～っこない to the negative stem of a verb. It can be translated as 'no way', 'no chance', or 'impossible.'","formation":"Verb-negative stem + っこない","examples":[{"jp":"こんなに雪が降っているんだから、学校に間に合いっこない。","romaji":"Konna ni yuki ga futteirun dakara, gakkō ni maniai kkonai.","en":"With snow falling this heavily, there's no way we'll make it to school on time.","words":[{"surface":"こんなに","vocabId":null},{"surface":"雪","vocabId":"1386500","reading":"ゆき"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"降っ","vocabId":"1282790","reading":"ふる"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いる","vocabId":"1577980","reading":"いる"},{"surface":"ん","vocabId":null},{"surface":"だ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"から","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"学校","vocabId":"1206730","reading":"がっこう"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"間に合い","vocabId":"1215260","reading":"まにあう"},{"surface":"っ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"こ","vocabId":"1307770","reading":"こ"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]},{"jp":"彼は泳げないので、プールの向こう側に泳いで行きっこない。","romaji":"Kare wa oyogenai node, pūru no mukōgawa ni oyoide ikkonai.","en":"Since he can’t swim, there’s no way he’ll make it to the other side of the pool.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"泳げ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ので","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"プール","vocabId":null},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"向こう","vocabId":"1277140","reading":"むこう"},{"surface":"側","vocabId":"1581310","reading":"がわ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"泳い","vocabId":"1174340","reading":"およぐ"},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null},{"surface":"行き","vocabId":"1578790","reading":"いき"},{"surface":"っ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"こ","vocabId":"1307770","reading":"こ"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]},{"jp":"彼女はとても怖がりなので、一人で夜の公園に行きっこない。","romaji":"Kanojo wa totemo kowagari na node, hitori de yoru no kōen ni ikkonai.","en":"She’s so timid, there’s no chance she’d go to the park alone at night.","words":[{"surface":"彼女","vocabId":"1483150","reading":"かのじょ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"とても","vocabId":null},{"surface":"怖がり","vocabId":"1496930","reading":"こわがる"},{"surface":"な","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ので","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"一","vocabId":"1160790","reading":"いち"},{"surface":"人","vocabId":"1580640","reading":"ひと"},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null},{"surface":"夜","vocabId":"1536350","reading":"よる"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"公園","vocabId":"1273270","reading":"こうえん"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"行き","vocabId":"1578790","reading":"いき"},{"surface":"っ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"こ","vocabId":"1307770","reading":"こ"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]},{"jp":"この短い時間で、その本を全部読むことはできっこない。","romaji":"Kono mijikai jikan de, sono hon o zenbu yomu koto wa dekikkonai.","en":"It's impossible to read the entire book in such a short time.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"短い","vocabId":"1418620","reading":"みじかい"},{"surface":"時間","vocabId":"1315920","reading":"じかん"},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"その","vocabId":null},{"surface":"本","vocabId":"1522150","reading":"ほん"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"全部","vocabId":"1396130","reading":"ぜんぶ"},{"surface":"読む","vocabId":"1456360","reading":"よむ"},{"surface":"こと","vocabId":"1313580","reading":"こと"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null},{"surface":"きっ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"こ","vocabId":"1307770","reading"